OL,3,GNEWSAMother killed by falling bricks,
OL,4,Acourt told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother on the school run sustained
OL,7,Ffatal injuries when a large pile of
OL,8,Fbricks fell on her head as she walked
OL,9,Fpast a building site in east London, a
OL,10,Fcourt has heard.
OL,12,FMichaela Boor, 29, was on Burdett Road
OL,13,Fin Bow on the morning of 27 March 2018
OL,14,Fwhen the accident happened. She
OL,15,Fsuffered a fractured skull and died two
OL,16,Fdays later.
OL,18,FHiggins Homes is on trial at the Old
OL,19,FBailey charged with corporate
OL,20,Fmanslaughter and a health and safety
OL,21,Foffence.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
